FerrionOS change to Zed (workspace Cargo.toml and Cargo.lock; licenses kept), made against release v1.29.3, commit d01b134cddf5e4f71964deb2d6f81cdb38fcf1e7:
- async-tar without its xattr feature: on this target it would define set_xattrs twice.
- [patch.crates-io]: wasmtime and wasmtime-wasi 48.0.7 and zbus 5.13.2 from patched copies in ferrion-vendor/, which the recipe's source script makes from the crates.io archives and wasmtime-48.0.7.patch, wasmtime-wasi-48.0.7.patch and zbus-5.13.2.patch; rustix 1.1.5 and cap-primitives 4.0.3 from a third party's forks that add this target, pinned by commit.
- Cargo.lock updated for the above, so the build still runs with --locked; libc moves to 0.2.191, which rustix 1.1.5 needs.

